I got this game for free since I have the Stock Car Extreme.
In few words...
- very solid plataform from rf1 engine with great enhancements in countless areas;
- great variety of out of the box cars and tracks (road class) with outstanding quality;
- great force feedback (ffb);
- great community of mods;
- DLCs to buy if you enjoy this game and want to try more, helping them to keep their work in the next title, hopefully in 2018 or who knows sooner;
A good advice if you are a beginner in simracing:
Be sure you properly configured your steering wheel range for each car do you want to drive. In my Logitech G25, I have to do a 3 steps procedure: (not sure about the other wheels).
1) go in the garage to check the wheel range options for the car.
2) exit the session to the main menu of the game and setup my wheel range (in the game)
3) load the session again and change in the garage the range you want to use.

